MAIN
MOVE TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 10 HALLOCATE TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 InheritFieldTest_ved_TestInheritFields
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 14
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 15
PRINT TEMP 4
END
InheritFieldTest_ved_TestInheritFields [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 16 8
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 8
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 Parent_ved_SetData
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 Child_ved_UseParentField
HSTORE TEMP 4 4 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 0
MOVE TEMP 24 TEMP 23
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 4
MOVE TEMP 25 CALL TEMP 6 ( TEMP 1 )
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 7
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 26 0
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 26

RETURN TEMP 8
END
Parent_ved_SetData [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 0
MOVE TEMP 27 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 2 4 TEMP 27
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Child_ved_UseParentField [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 28 55
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 0
MOVE TEMP 29 TEMP 2
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 29
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 30 45
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 6
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 7
PRINT TEMP 1

RETURN TEMP 1
END

